'''Century Cakes''' are {{Uncommon}} items. They are placeable [[Furniture]] which give small [[Stat]] bonuses when consumed.

== Obtaining ==
'''Century Cakes''' can obtained via various methods: 
*From {{NPCSprite|Simon}} every 100 SkyBlock Years.
*During [[Raffle of the Century]] as a {{Yellow|'''MINOR'''}} reward and as a consolation reward from the {{Raffle|Big One}}.
*By consuming the {{Item|Complete Century Cake Bundle}} or the{{Item|Random Century Cake Bundle}} 
*By being chosen as a reward from a {{Item|Gift Bag of the Century}}.

== Mechanics == 
To activate a cake's effects, they must be right clicked while placed down on the {{Zone|Private Island}}. Cakes placed on others' Islands can grant their effects. Once placed down, they will never disappear, work as [[Furniture]] (but have their own furniture limit), and can be used endlessly.

There are {{Green|20}} different types, each giving a different stat bonus for {{Green|48}} hours. These 48 hours include offline time, similar to the {{Item|Booster Cookie}}, but they can be eaten again to reset the cooldown.

If the player has more than 8 hours of playtime, a '''Century Cake''' will have a {{Green|0.1%}} chance to drop a {{Item|Cake Soul}} of its color when eaten. {{Item|Cake Soul}}s are not obtainable while the stat boost from a '''Century Cake''' is still active.

